{
  "id": "29660_oshitomeru",
  "headword": "{押|お}し{止|と}める",
  "reading": "おしとめる",
  "romaji": "oshitomeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to hold back; to stop by force",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to hold back; to stop by force",
      "explanation": "To physically stop or restrain a person, movement, or action from continuing, typically by pushing against it or otherwise applying force."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29660_oshitomeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{相手|あいて}を{押|お}し{止|と}める。",
      "english": "To hold the other person back.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29660_oshitomeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{飛|と}び{出|だ}そうとする{子供|こども}を{押|お}し{止|と}めた。",
      "english": "I held back the child who was about to dash out.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29660_oshitomeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{警備員|けいびいん}が{群衆|ぐんしゅう}を{門|もん}の{前|まえ}で{押|お}し{止|と}めた。",
      "english": "The guards held the crowd back in front of the gate.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive ichidan verb. Xを{押|お}し{止|と}める. A compound of {押|お}す (to push) and {止|と}める (to stop), so it implies stopping something by pushing against it or holding it in place.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {群衆|ぐんしゅう}を{押|お}し{止|と}める: to hold back a crowd\n- {勢|いきお}いを{押|お}し{止|と}める: to check the momentum of something\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {食|く}い{止|と}める: to check; to hold in check — stresses preventing spread or worsening, often figurative\n- {引|ひ}き{止|と}める: to hold back; to detain — stops someone from leaving, often by persuasion",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
